    "Selection order: HARD GATES -> OPPORTUNITY -> JOB/ROLE -> TRAIT FIT -> NEED/EMOTION -> RELATIONSHIP -> HISTORY -> COOLDOWN/RARITY -> SCORE.",
    "Hard-gate failure means impossible, not just unlikely.",
    "Tier 1-4 use the same full NPC data. Tier only changes how often deep deliberation runs. Important events can force immediate deep update.",
